acket sniffing on shared networks (Ethernet hubs)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>2000s</strong>: Wi-Fi p=
roliferation, wireless MITM attacks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>2010s</strong>: Nation-=
state attacks, sophisticated SSL/TLS interception</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Present</strong>: Publi=
c Wi-Fi attacks, DNS spoofing, BGP hijacking</li>
</ol>
