ession-Based Auth</strong>:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Server Control</strong>=
: Complete control over session lifecycle</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Security</strong>: Sens=
itive data kh=C3=B4ng exposed trong client</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Immediate Revocation</s=
trong>: Can instantly invalidate sessions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Detailed Logging</stron=
g>: Track all session activities</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Flexible Data</strong>:=
 Can store complex session data</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Disadvantages</strong>:<=
/p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Scalability</strong>: R=
equires shared session store across servers</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory Usage</strong>: =
Server memory consumption grows v=E1=BB=9Bi active users</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Single Point of Failure=
</strong>: Session store outage affects all users</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stateful</strong>: Viol=
ates stateless architecture principles</li>
</ol>
