<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>JWT Advantages</strong>:=
</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Stateless</strong>: No =
server-side storage required</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Scalable</strong>: Work=
s v=E1=BB=9Bi load balancers, microservices</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Self-contained</strong>=
: All auth info trong token</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cross-domain</strong>: =
Can work across different domains/services</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mobile-friendly</strong=
>: Easy to implement trong mobile apps</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>JWT Disadvantages</stron=
g>:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Token Size</strong>: La=
rger than session IDs (especially v=E1=BB=9Bi many claims)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Revocation Complexity</=
strong>: Hard to invalidate before expiration</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Security Risk</strong>:=
 If compromised, valid until expiration</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Storage Decision</stron=
g>: Must choose gi=E1=BB=AFa localStorage (XSS risk) ho=E1=BA=B7c cookies</=
li>
</ol>
